## 🛠️ 2. Rapid Archetype Scaffolding CLI

Generate self-contained HTML/CSS templates instantly:

```bash
# Generate a Mythic Parchment page for Norse or Greek mythology
python3 config/skills/creative-web-design-archetypes/scripts/archetype_template_generator.py \
  mythic-parchment --title "Chronicles of the Elder Gods" --out dist/pantheon.html

# Generate a Neo-Brutalist tool portal
python3 config/skills/creative-web-design-archetypes/scripts/archetype_template_generator.py \
  neo-brutalism --title "OGSR Modding Toolkit" --out dist/tools.html

# Generate a Cyberpunk terminal dashboard
python3 config/skills/creative-web-design-archetypes/scripts/archetype_template_generator.py \
  cyberpunk-terminal --title "Zone Radiation Telemetry" --out dist/telemetry.html
```

